# Rapier Wit: the stun counter goes on only "if it's your turn" as the spell resolves. Cast in Bot2's upkeep of turn four it
# taps Bot2's Ornithopter and draws a card, and puts no counter on it, so it untaps as usual on turn six.

[Bot1 Deck]
Rapier Wit
Mox Pearl x2
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Rapier Wit.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Stun = (absent)
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
[T6 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
